WEBVTT

00:46:57.327 --> 00:47:00.323
he better have a great
studio setup at home.

00:47:00.864 --> 00:47:03.737
DF: Well, if that includes
a blanket hanging from a rafter

00:47:03.761 --> 00:47:08.009
and my daughter's purple
headphones as my headset, then yes.

00:47:08.033 --> 00:47:09.736
(Laughter)